        <span class="card__phase-label">Phase 02</span>
        <h2 class="card__heading">The Vibe Coding to Agentic Engineering Spectrum</h2>
        <p class="card__body">The decisive differentiator is not whether AI is used, but how much structure, verification, and human judgment surrounds its output. Vibe coding — casual prompting with minimal review — suits prototypes and personal projects; agentic engineering — automated test suites, CI/CD gates, and LM-judge evals — is required for production systems that organisations depend on.</p>
