        <span class="card__phase-label">Phase 04</span>
        <h2 class="card__heading">AI Across Every SDLC Phase</h2>
        <p class="card__body">Requirements become a live human-AI conversation producing specs and prototypes simultaneously. Architecture stays human-centric for trade-off decisions. Implementation shifts from writing to reviewing and guiding AI output. Testing demands both output evaluation and trajectory evaluation. Code review and deployment gain AI-powered augmentation, and maintenance of once-impenetrable legacy codebases becomes tractable.</p>
      </article>

